  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全員、忘れ物はないかー？\r\n何かあればコンビニ寄るけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010620,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "イルミネ、問題ありません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010620"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010630,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "昨日、みんなで確認のメッセ回したもんねー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010630"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010640,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ、うん……っ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010640"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010650,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お、まののんたち優秀～\r\nうちは大丈夫ー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010660,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今回は咲耶にも見てもらったけん平気ばい！\r\nお弁当も忘れとらんよ～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010660"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010670,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ\r\n恋鐘も摩美々も、忘れ物はないはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010670"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010680,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私たちも、もちろん問題ないわ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010680"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010690,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "強いて言うなら、\r\n持ち込んだお菓子が足りるかどうかが心配……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010690"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010700,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いざとなったら\r\n向こうで買い足せばいいだろー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010700"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010710,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "アルストロメリアも大丈夫でーす☆",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010710"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010720,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "今日は……！\r\n荷造り、完璧……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010720"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001015010730,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ま、なんか忘れててもなんとかなるっしょ！\r\nうちらも平気ーっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0017",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101501/4001015010730"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、じゃあ一旦このまま行くな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00075",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "0295",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ターミナルまでは大体１時間\r\nそこから船に乗って、さらに３時間強",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結構な長旅だ、\r\n体調が悪くなったりしたら遠慮せず申し出てくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
